      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-12T17:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why do you need sk-\u003esocket? If you only need it to access sk_socket-\u003efile so that you can get the UID, just delete this code and use sk_uid instead. Then you can avoid taking sk_callback_lock and possibly improve performance.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1744,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 1744,
        "endChar": 34
      },
      "revId": "b80dc73f28ec1921b181be03ffe1f6f65588d5ce",
